sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Magpie
  participant M as Model
  A->>G: Messages + tools
  G->>M: Model request
  M-->>G: Tool + arguments + id
  G-->>A: Client tool call
  Note over A: Execute tool
  A->>G: Tool result + id
  G->>M: Continue
  M-->>G: Reply
  G-->>A: Client reply
